{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0330"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge history/modern-history","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/history__modern-history.g2.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",76],["-","five"],["+","six"],["=",25],["-","policy"],["+","policy,"],["=",1],["+","struggle "],["=",2],["-","struggle."],["+","mood."],["=",627],["+","One label was a boast rather than a sneer. In Germany the years between the end of hyperinflation in 1924 and the Wall Street Crash of 1929 are remembered as the Golden Twenties, and the decade as a whole – the 1920s – as an age of jazz, cabaret, cinema and the Bauhaus; Americans speak of the Roaring Twenties. The name was largely a product of hindsight: for the Weimar Republic it was a brief flowering between two catastrophes, ended by the Depression and, four years later, by Hitler's seizure of power.\n\n"],["=",107],["+","\n| Golden Twenties | Germany | c. 1924–1929 |"],["=",118]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",74],["-","fünf"],["+","sechs"],["=",25],["-","Politik"],["+","Politik,"],["=",1],["-","oder "],["=",6],["+","oder eine Stimmung "],["=",622],["+","Ein Etikett war eher Prahlerei als Spott. In Deutschland gelten die Jahre zwischen dem Ende der Hyperinflation 1924 und dem Börsenkrach von 1929 als die Goldenen Zwanziger, und das ganze Jahrzehnt – die 1920er Jahre – als Zeit von Jazz, Kabarett, Kino und Bauhaus; die Amerikaner sprechen von den Roaring Twenties. Der Name entstand vor allem im Rückblick: Für die Weimarer Republik war es eine kurze Blüte zwischen zwei Katastrophen, beendet durch die Weltwirtschaftskrise und vier Jahre später durch Hitlers Machtergreifung.\n\n"],["=",101],["+","\n| Goldene Zwanziger | Deutschland | ca. 1924–1929 |"],["=",122]]}]},
